  "h1": "Traditional Bank vs Online Bank by Cash Habits and Savings Goals",
  "introText": "Pick an online bank if you want lower fees and higher savings yields and rarely handle cash, and pick a traditional bank if you deposit cash or want in-person service. A traditional bank also fits people who want everything under one roof. Either type protects your deposits only if the bank is insured by the [Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation (FDIC)](https://www.fdic.gov/resources/deposit-insurance). For the traditional bank vs online bank choice, that means counting your cash deposits and comparing current terms at specific banks.",
